{
    "$comment": "WCH-2: full time, the added time alert and the screen kept on (VIB-1, VIB-7, UI-12). Without stoppage tracked full time repeats until a button (VIB-6); with it and stoppage time when the period's length is reached, full time vibrates once, with nothing to answer, and the added time alert repeats until a button; with it but no stoppage time then, full time repeats until a button, as no added time alert follows, and stands for that alert for the period.",
